# NYC Air Predication

A polished NYC short-term rental prediction app that combines a machine-learning model with a clean dashboard interface. The project lets users input listing attributes like borough, price, neighborhood, and host history, and then receive a prediction with confidence scores from a live FastAPI backend.

![NYC skyline preview](https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499092346589-b9b6be3e94b73?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=80)

## Overview

This project demonstrates a practical end-to-end ML workflow:
- A Python + scikit-learn model generates predictions
- A FastAPI service exposes the trained pipeline
- A lightweight web dashboard visualizes the result in real time

The app is designed for local use and portfolio presentation, making it easy to run and showcase.

## Features

- NYC listing prediction from structured listing attributes
- Borough and neighborhood-aware form input
- FastAPI health checks and prediction endpoint
- Real-time confidence and probability breakdown
- Dark, modern dashboard styling for a more professional look
- Easy local setup for demo and experimentation

